memtest86 (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for deepin 25.
  * Memory diagnostic tool inspired by memtest86:
    - 9 test algorithms (walking ones, own address, moving inversions,
      block move, random sequence, bit fade)
    - CLI mode and DTK6 GUI mode
    - i18n following system locale (Chinese / English)

